1
00:00:46,705 --> 00:00:52,071
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,096 --> 00:00:54,053
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:54,078 --> 00:00:55,873
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,898 --> 00:00:58,832
=Episode 11=

5
00:00:59,719 --> 00:01:00,359
From now on,

6
00:01:00,799 --> 00:01:01,960
you're all my brothers.

7
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:04,120
My brothers live standing tall.

8
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:05,159
Get up.

9
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:10,239
We stand tall!

10
00:01:10,239 --> 00:01:11,480
We stand tall!

11
00:01:11,504 --> 00:01:14,090
We stand tall!

12
00:01:15,383 --> 00:01:16,015
Ah!

13
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:16,456
Hey!

14
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:16,920
Stop!

15
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:17,519
That's the woman.

16
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:19,845
Come here.

17
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,480
She's the one who set Boss up last time.

18
00:01:21,719 --> 00:01:22,280
It wasn't me.

19
00:01:22,280 --> 00:01:23,599
You've scammed a lot of people lately.

20
00:01:23,599 --> 00:01:24,319
It wasn't me.

21
00:01:24,319 --> 00:01:24,799
Still denying it?

22
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:25,480
Come here.

23
00:01:32,599 --> 00:01:32,920
I'm sorry.

24
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:35,239
I didn't know you were Mian.

25
00:01:36,280 --> 00:01:37,280
Dashan lied to me.

26
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:38,760
He said...

27
00:01:39,120 --> 00:01:39,599
he could help me

28
00:01:40,319 --> 00:01:41,920
find... find Wu.

29
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:42,760
I was just...

30
00:01:43,359 --> 00:01:44,359
trying to find my son.

31
00:01:44,799 --> 00:01:45,799
I had no choice.

32
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,439
No choice?

33
00:01:47,719 --> 00:01:48,100
Yeah.

34
00:01:48,799 --> 00:01:49,759
So your solution was

35
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:50,719
to lure them to Langia,

36
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:52,365
then personally

37
00:01:52,366 --> 00:01:53,879
lock them up in cages as piggies,

38
00:01:54,959 --> 00:01:56,309
or personally hand them over

39
00:01:56,310 --> 00:01:57,359
to Suowen's operating table?

40
00:01:58,760 --> 00:01:59,719
That's your solution?

41
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:00,560
Kill her!

42
00:02:00,760 --> 00:02:01,920
Kill her!

43
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:04,159
- Kill her!
- I'm sorry.

44
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,879
I'm sorry.

45
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:07,560
Beat me or kill me.

46
00:02:08,319 --> 00:02:08,960
Do whatever you want.

47
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:10,879
Just help me

48
00:02:11,599 --> 00:02:12,919
find Wu.

49
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:14,520
I beg you!

50
00:02:15,199 --> 00:02:16,000
Please! I beg you!

51
00:02:16,919 --> 00:02:18,039
Please! I beg you!

52
00:02:18,039 --> 00:02:18,759
Please!

53
00:02:18,759 --> 00:02:19,159
Fine.

54
00:02:21,800 --> 00:02:22,800
I'll find Wu for you.

55
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,159
As for you,

56
00:02:27,319 --> 00:02:28,120
you're on your own from here.

57
00:02:28,719 --> 00:02:29,080
I'm sorry.

58
00:02:29,639 --> 00:02:30,240
I'm sorry.

59
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:30,680
Go home.

60
00:02:31,800 --> 00:02:34,159
I'm sorry.

61
00:02:38,719 --> 00:02:40,439
So now you finally know who I am.

62
00:02:41,479 --> 00:02:42,039
Surprised?

63
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:44,639
I had my suspicions.

64
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:47,199
You used me from the start,

65
00:02:48,159 --> 00:02:49,039
but you kept helping me.

66
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:50,639
You had an agenda,

67
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:51,719
you had connections,

68
00:02:51,719 --> 00:02:52,560
and you're a good person.

69
00:02:53,120 --> 00:02:54,319
Odds are, you're a cop.

70
00:02:55,319 --> 00:02:56,259
Still, thank you

71
00:02:56,260 --> 00:02:57,199
for risking your life to save me.

72
00:02:58,479 --> 00:02:59,120
You're welcome.

73
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:01,360
After all, you're Mian now.

74
00:03:02,319 --> 00:03:03,439
Dashan's dead.

75
00:03:03,719 --> 00:03:05,479
Only two of Langia's Big Three remain.

76
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,560
If Natuo kills you,

77
00:03:08,319 --> 00:03:10,400
wouldn't Songcai Group
dominate Langia?

78
00:03:11,319 --> 00:03:12,960
Then taking them down

79
00:03:13,439 --> 00:03:14,159
would be even harder.

80
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,520
Why are you so set on taking them down?

81
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,404
Don't the Langia police

82
00:03:19,405 --> 00:03:20,840
and the Big Three stay out
of each other's way?

83
00:03:23,919 --> 00:03:25,319
Taking them down is only step one.

84
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:26,719
What I'm really after

85
00:03:27,159 --> 00:03:28,319
is the real Mian.

86
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,599
My dad's a cop.

87
00:03:33,719 --> 00:03:35,879
Back when Mian was at his peak,

88
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:38,879
my dad did all he could to catch him.

89
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:41,120
But I never expected

90
00:03:42,039 --> 00:03:43,219
Mian to stoop so low

91
00:03:43,220 --> 00:03:44,400
as to go after my family.

92
00:04:25,319 --> 00:04:26,196
No wonder you got so worked up

93
00:04:26,197 --> 00:04:27,199
when you found out I was Mian.

94
00:04:30,360 --> 00:04:32,279
My mom shot Mian with a shotgun.

95
00:04:33,079 --> 00:04:35,439
The scars on his chest
should show a shotgun spread,

96
00:04:36,079 --> 00:04:36,879
not like yours,

97
00:04:37,199 --> 00:04:38,279
which is clearly self-inflicted.

98
00:04:40,759 --> 00:04:41,560
That's how I knew

99
00:04:42,199 --> 00:04:43,519
you weren't the Mian I'm after.

100
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:46,600
Zhou Yan.

101
00:04:47,879 --> 00:04:48,879
Have you ever seen Mian?

102
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,720
If I track down the real Mian,

103
00:04:56,079 --> 00:04:57,480
will you stand against me?

104
00:04:58,439 --> 00:04:59,199
I've never seen Mian.

105
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:01,560
That's right.

106
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:03,993
I'm using Mian's identity

107
00:05:03,994 --> 00:05:04,560
to get my revenge.

108
00:05:05,079 --> 00:05:06,480
But Mian is using me too.

109
00:05:07,560 --> 00:05:08,759
I'll always be Zhou Yan.

110
00:05:08,759 --> 00:05:10,040
I'll never become the real Mian.

111
00:05:11,519 --> 00:05:12,000
So...

112
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:13,759
against the Big Three,

113
00:05:13,759 --> 00:05:14,439
we can work together.

114
00:05:50,519 --> 00:05:51,279
Whoa!

115
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:54,560
That's awesome!

116
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:57,360
Hey!

117
00:05:58,970 --> 00:05:59,536
Hey!

118
00:05:59,560 --> 00:05:59,900
Boss!

119
00:06:02,199 --> 00:06:02,600
This is for you.

120
00:06:05,439 --> 00:06:05,839
For me?

121
00:06:07,759 --> 00:06:08,599
Back then, you sold me out

122
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:09,680
just to get a crappy motorbike.

123
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:10,680
Got you a new one.

124
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:12,199
And them.

125
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:21,399
Boss!

126
00:06:30,079 --> 00:06:30,480
Boss!

127
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:32,040
You're awesome!

128
00:06:33,839 --> 00:06:35,439
Ma Ding!

129
00:06:35,839 --> 00:06:36,240
Ma Ding!

130
00:06:39,199 --> 00:06:39,879
Call me Ding.

131
00:06:39,879 --> 00:06:40,639
Okay.

132
00:06:40,639 --> 00:06:42,279
Ding.

133
00:06:43,639 --> 00:06:44,120
I've got it.

134
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:45,000
From now on,

135
00:06:45,439 --> 00:06:45,959
we'll be called...

136
00:06:46,319 --> 00:06:47,360
Swift as Wind, Fierce as Fire,

137
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:48,839
Langia Dark Star Gang!

138
00:06:49,399 --> 00:06:50,000
Ma Ding.

139
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,199
That name's way too long.

140
00:06:51,199 --> 00:06:52,120
Who's going to remember it?

141
00:06:52,800 --> 00:06:53,319
Keep it simple.

142
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:54,759
Call it...

143
00:06:55,439 --> 00:06:55,800
Blaze Gang.

144
00:06:56,439 --> 00:06:56,879
Blaze Gang!

145
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:57,759
Blaze Gang sounds good.

146
00:06:59,240 --> 00:06:59,600
From now on,

147
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:00,839
we're the Blaze Gang.

148
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,240
Good.

149
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:06,040
Blaze Gang!

150
00:07:28,399 --> 00:07:28,920
Greetings.

151
00:07:32,519 --> 00:07:33,079
Greetings.

152
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:49,920
What do you want?

153
00:07:53,519 --> 00:07:54,639
Suowen, your stuff

154
00:07:55,519 --> 00:07:56,879
has always been top-notch, right?

155
00:07:58,120 --> 00:07:59,199
Too bad.

156
00:07:59,199 --> 00:08:00,319
With Dashan gone,

157
00:08:01,360 --> 00:08:02,519
you lose

158
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:03,959
your body packers

159
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:05,240
with every run.

160
00:08:07,560 --> 00:08:08,519
So how will you move your stuff

161
00:08:08,519 --> 00:08:09,439
from now on?

162
00:08:13,800 --> 00:08:15,199
Is that why you asked me here?

163
00:08:16,839 --> 00:08:17,480
Don't worry.

164
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:19,040
Even without Dashan,

165
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:20,879
I have other options.

166
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:25,800
Suowen.

167
00:08:26,839 --> 00:08:28,040
Why make it so hard?

168
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:30,040
My mine

169
00:08:30,519 --> 00:08:31,639
has trucks coming and going

170
00:08:31,639 --> 00:08:33,080
all day long.

171
00:08:33,519 --> 00:08:34,919
Why go looking elsewhere?

172
00:08:37,159 --> 00:08:38,080
Besides,

173
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:40,799
Mian...

174
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:42,639
you and I

175
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:44,080
have both crossed him, right?

176
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:47,720
Do you think

177
00:08:48,279 --> 00:08:49,240
he'll let us off?

178
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:00,519
Instead of waiting to die,

179
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:03,039
let's take him out together.

180
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:06,200
But he is Mian, after all.

181
00:09:08,039 --> 00:09:09,000
For that kind of money,

182
00:09:09,679 --> 00:09:12,200
it's not worth the risk.

183
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:17,200
What if I told you

184
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:19,840
I'd hand you Mian's heart

185
00:09:20,120 --> 00:09:21,720
myself?

186
00:09:29,519 --> 00:09:30,840
Suowen.

187
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:34,120
Who cares if he's Mian?

188
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:36,639
No one's heard from him in three years.

189
00:09:37,519 --> 00:09:38,240
Without him,

190
00:09:38,799 --> 00:09:40,360
we've done just fine, haven't we?

191
00:09:43,159 --> 00:09:43,879
Since Mian

192
00:09:44,600 --> 00:09:45,639
wants to start a fire,

193
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:48,120
then you and I can join forces

194
00:09:48,519 --> 00:09:49,399
and put it out.

195
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:54,039
Then the heart you've been after

196
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,120
will finally be yours.

197
00:10:11,320 --> 00:10:12,039
Deal.

198
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:34,919
Suowen.

199
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:36,799
Till next time!

200
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:45,559
Hey.

201
00:10:47,120 --> 00:10:48,360
The men are all here.

202
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,960
Why aren't the other bosses here yet?

203
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:51,000
Didn't we agree on this?

204
00:10:51,639 --> 00:10:52,000
Boss.

205
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,159
I'll go ask again.

206
00:10:53,799 --> 00:10:55,000
They don't break their word.

207
00:10:55,679 --> 00:10:56,399
I think...

208
00:10:56,919 --> 00:10:57,799
something must've happened.

209
00:10:58,799 --> 00:10:59,600
Forget them.

210
00:11:00,039 --> 00:11:01,039
I've waited so long I'm starving.

211
00:11:01,039 --> 00:11:01,639
Let's eat first.

212
00:11:01,879 --> 00:11:02,679
We'll talk after dinner.

213
00:11:08,290 --> 00:11:09,249
Oh, man.

214
00:11:09,960 --> 00:11:10,960
Oh, no.

215
00:11:11,879 --> 00:11:12,445
These are all

216
00:11:12,446 --> 00:11:13,200
the bosses' trusted men.

217
00:11:13,759 --> 00:11:14,080
Boss!

218
00:11:14,519 --> 00:11:15,360
They've all been hacked up!

219
00:11:17,080 --> 00:11:18,200
Suowen. Natuo.

220
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:20,559
They moved faster than I expected.

221
00:11:22,919 --> 00:11:23,360
Let's go.

222
00:11:48,039 --> 00:11:48,960
This is bad.

223
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:50,120
They're all here.

224
00:12:07,110 --> 00:12:08,435
♪Dust rises along the border♪

225
00:12:08,460 --> 00:12:09,780
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

226
00:12:09,780 --> 00:12:11,140
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

227
00:12:11,140 --> 00:12:12,540
♪Brothers yesterday, foes today♪

228
00:12:12,540 --> 00:12:13,900
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

229
00:12:13,900 --> 00:12:15,220
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

230
00:12:15,220 --> 00:12:16,540
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

231
00:12:16,540 --> 00:12:18,220
♪My life is mine to bear♪

232
00:12:18,366 --> 00:12:20,726
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

233
00:12:20,750 --> 00:12:23,350
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

234
00:12:23,396 --> 00:12:25,670
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

235
00:12:25,670 --> 00:12:27,085
♪My fate is mine to command♪

236
00:12:27,110 --> 00:12:28,246
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

237
00:12:28,270 --> 00:12:29,525
♪I weave through storms of bullets♪

238
00:12:29,550 --> 00:12:30,805
♪I fight through flashing blades♪

239
00:12:30,830 --> 00:12:32,123
♪Blood stains the whole land red♪

240
00:12:32,150 --> 00:12:33,551
♪The bonds we forged stay in my heart♪

241
00:12:33,576 --> 00:12:35,171
♪Plots and schemes are everywhere♪

242
00:12:35,196 --> 00:12:36,558
♪Deceit runs deep, hard to see through♪

243
00:12:36,583 --> 00:12:37,731
♪Every step is planned. I won't retreat♪

244
00:12:37,756 --> 00:12:39,251
♪A spark ignites in the dark♪

245
00:12:39,276 --> 00:12:40,584
♪So what if fate mocks me?♪

246
00:12:40,609 --> 00:12:41,669
♪This fight will defy fate itself♪

247
00:12:41,694 --> 00:12:42,998
♪Break every shackle, break every lock♪

248
00:12:43,023 --> 00:12:47,289
♪Anger burns inside my chest♪

249
00:12:48,693 --> 00:12:49,901
♪With blood and sweat♪

250
00:12:49,925 --> 00:12:51,424
♪I forge my glory♪

251
00:12:51,448 --> 00:12:52,584
♪In this world of chaos♪

252
00:12:52,608 --> 00:12:53,888
♪I carve out a road to brighter days♪

253
00:12:53,912 --> 00:12:55,352
♪My legend♪

254
00:12:55,376 --> 00:12:57,009
♪I'll write every chapter myself♪

255
00:13:01,352 --> 00:13:03,825
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

256
00:13:03,849 --> 00:13:06,412
♪I crush the thorns and reach the dawn♪

257
00:13:06,806 --> 00:13:08,834
♪I fight back from death on all fronts♪

258
00:13:08,858 --> 00:13:10,151
♪My fate is mine to command♪

259
00:13:10,175 --> 00:13:11,497
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪

260
00:13:19,453 --> 00:13:20,774
♪My fate is mine to command♪

261
00:13:20,798 --> 00:13:22,358
♪Who dares stand in my way?♪
